id=freeform-feature-declare
name=Declare freeform_window_management feature
version=1.0
versionCode=1
author=MarcelQ (OpenLauncher bench)
description=Declares the android.software.freeform_window_management system feature (adds the missing /system/etc/permissions XML systemlessly) and sets enable_freeform_support + force_resizable_activities at boot. For the SPD trinket bench; disable from the Magisk Modules switch to revert.
